  "body": "What changed\nTheme Browse and the Fixtures menu file rows are disabled in the browser when unsupported. Their hover text gives the refusal reason. Desktop rows stay available. This completes the menu-state work left after merged PR #1438 added Save, Save As and Post downloads and merged PR #1314 added model and project pickers.\n\nFork synced at v0.19.0. This issue branch includes upstream/main through 4f4edcf.\n\nCause\nCommand dispatch refused these actions, but the menus still presented live rows. The menus now use the same refusal table and expose their disabled state to accessibility tools.\n\nTests\nPins: browser_theme_browse_is_disabled_with_a_reason and browser_fixture_file_rows_are_disabled_with_reasons. They check browser and desktop states, refusal text, and disabled clicks. The earlier run recorded both pins red before the fix. The earlier run also recorded restoration mutations: restoring each original menu file made its pin fail; restoring the fix made it pass. Fresh verification at 69a9825 passed both pins, cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main (4f4edcf; 1 step, 0 failures), and cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings. RUSTC_WRAPPER= avoided the previously recorded sccache infrastructure failure.\n\nGoldens moved\nNone.\n\nNot exercised\nNo browser session or wasm compilation was run for this fix.\n\nOverlaps\nOpen PR #1639 also touches structural.rs, in different functions. These pins live in a separate child module.\n\nChangelog: Unsupported browser Theme and Fixtures menu file commands are disabled with a reason (#1431).\n\nFixes #1431\n\n\n## Screenshots\n\nRendered off-screen with the UI test harness in browser mode, using the default dark theme at 1280×720. BEFORE uses upstream/main (d2350d6a); AFTER uses PR head b706db9c. Upstream/main also has newer ribbon and browser styling; those surrounding differences are outside this PR.\n\n| Before | After |\n| --- | --- |\n| ![before theme](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/1687/before-theme.png) | ![after theme](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/1687/after-theme.png) |\n| ![before fixtures](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/1687/before-fixtures.png) | ![after fixtures](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/1687/after-fixtures.png) |\n\nTheme: Browse is dimmed and hovering explains why the browser cannot open theme files.\n\nFixtures: unsupported file rows are dimmed, and hovering Import fixture shows its refusal reason.\n",
